From skeid #33 audit: Protocol/Ollama.pm request_to_openai forwards messages as-is. Ollama's assistant message tool_calls[].function.arguments is an OBJECT, OpenAI chat/completions expects a string (and a tool message needs tool_call_id, which Ollama lacks). Translate: arguments object -> character JSON string (encode_json_text_safe), synthesize ids for assistant tool_calls and map following role=tool messages to them in order (Ollama tool messages carry tool_name). Tests with a mock upstream.
